Package: ConservationAnalysisTool
Title: Compare Conserved Regions of Regulation
Version: 0.0.2.0000
Authors@R: 
    person("Minhein", "Htet", , "htetm@uchicago.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to help analyze and compare which genes and
    accompanying regulatory regions are structurally conserved between
    species from two lists of genes/regions. Regions of Regulation are
    expected to be 500 kilo base or higher to reflect potential
    Topologically Associating Domains.
